			"arabicnumber": 618,
			"text": "Narrated Ali ibn AbuTalib: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: The key of prayer is purification; takbir (saying \"Allah is most great\") makes (all acts which break prayer) unlawful and taslim (uttering the salutation) makes (all such acts) lawful",
